# Base .gitignore Template

Copy to project root as `.gitignore` or merge with project-specific entries.

```gitignore
# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Build
build/
dist/
out/
target/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.gradle/

# Env
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Logs
*.log

# Secrets
*.jks
*.keystore
local.properties

# Temp
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
```
